# The build context is the repository root: every Dockerfile COPYs
# <scanner>/code and common/samma_finding from here (release.yaml, docker
# compose). Keep the context small and keep caches and local output out of
# the images. Nothing below is COPYed by any Dockerfile.
.git
.github
charts
tests
*.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
**/.pytest_cache
**/out
**/docker-compose.yaml
**/filebeat
**/manifest
